[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-10559"] :question/problem "Calculate\n$\\int (4{cos}^{2}⁡x-2)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡x$ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=2{cos}^{2}⁡x-1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4{cos}^{2}⁡x-2)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4(\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+1))-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+2-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x)+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-51126/selection/d427b944e26709d5f365fc6b5711be004a0a3509f614cbfd4943dc70d3f6d84e" :answer/id #uuid "5984ac9f-2835-5f33-a158-60355d52e40e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51126/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "d2af47ef-76c7-5f0b-8538-94f85021dbeb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51126/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "d65d5927-bfb8-5799-9a36-4be823721147" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51126/selection/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" :answer/id #uuid "297647da-3ab3-5dcc-9a0f-48a9dc1e495f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51126/selection/523b37883474afade764165f552bc128b7640323ff7244275508d19e6f99b277" :answer/id #uuid "ae3104d2-922a-56ba-ad75-57e2cb7a3a3c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51126/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "20bf7902-d8bf-522c-b9ef-2ee403332062" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-51126/selection/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" :answer-field/choices ["q-51126/selection/d427b944e26709d5f365fc6b5711be004a0a3509f614cbfd4943dc70d3f6d84e" "q-51126/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-51126/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" "q-51126/selection/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" "q-51126/selection/523b37883474afade764165f552bc128b7640323ff7244275508d19e6f99b277"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-51126" :question/id #uuid "d3c3918e-b0d8-54bc-84f9-50f26c7e5758" :question/math-academy-id "q-51126" :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}({cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x={cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}({cos}^{2}⁡2x-{sin}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /24}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x}{4}{|}_{0}^{\\pi /24} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{24})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot 0)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(\\frac{1}{2}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-51126/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "064d3c62-5cfc-502b-aba4-48e40042593f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-51126"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
